{#- The brain's situation (subconscious/situation.py): one picture of the moment, the same for every brain decider
    (docs/design/brain_delegates_work_2026-10-04.md, section 2). Expects `s`; times are shown local. Each object
    shows its label of the call (`ref`, set by the decider's code: day_tasks.project), never its id. -#}
## The moment
Now: {{ s.now | local_time }} ({{ s.weekday }})
{% set p = s.presence -%}
{% if p.status_label == "AWAY" -%}
The owner is away from the keyboard{% if p.start_time_local %}, since {{ p.start_time_local }}{% endif %} ({{ p.duration_minutes | int }} minutes).
{%- elif p.status_label == "AT_KEYBOARD" -%}
The owner is at the keyboard{% if p.start_time_local %}, since {{ p.start_time_local }}{% endif %}.
{%- else -%}
Whether the owner is at the keyboard is not known right now.
{%- endif %}
{%- if s.activity %}
At and away from the computer today:
{%- for a in s.activity %}
- {{ a.start | local_time }} {% if a.ongoing %}until now{% else %}to {{ a.end | local_time }}{% endif %}: {{ {"Active": "at the computer", "AFK": "away", "Intermittent": "on and off"}[a.type] }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
Where the owner is, and expected to be in the next 24 hours:
{{ s.location }}
Weather: {% if s.weather.condition %}{{ s.weather.city }}, {{ s.weather.temperature }} F, {{ s.weather.condition }}{% else %}(not known){% endif %}
Health today: {{ s.health or "(no assessment yet)" }}

## Today
{% if s.day_theme %}Day theme: {{ s.day_theme }}
{% endif %}{% if s.current_status %}Status: {{ s.current_status }}
{% endif %}Today's schedule ({{ s.day }}):
{% for e in s.calendar_today -%}
- {% if e.ref is defined %}[{{ e.ref }}] {% endif %}{{ e.title }} {{ e.start_local }}{% if e.end_local %} - {{ e.end_local }}{% endif %}{% if e.status %} ({{ e.status }}){% endif %}
{% else -%}
(nothing on the schedule)
{% endfor %}
Dates that matter coming up:
{{ s.key_dates }}

The calendar ahead:
{% for l in s.calendar_ahead -%}
{% if l.ref is defined %}- [{{ l.ref }}] {{ l.text }}{% elif l.event %}- {{ l.text }}{% else %}{{ l.text }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

## The owner's chat today
{% for m in s.chat -%}
{% if m.ref is defined %}[{{ m.ref }}] {% endif %}[{{ m.at | local_time }}] {{ m.speaker }}: {{ m.text }}
{% else -%}
(no finished conversation yet today)
{% endfor %}
## The owner's todo list
{% for t in s.todos -%}
- {{ t.title }} ({{ t.status }}{% if t.due %}, due {{ t.due }}{% endif %})
{% else -%}
(empty)
{% endfor %}
## Work the assistant has in motion
{% for w in s.work.in_motion -%}
- {% if w.ref is defined %}[{{ w.ref }}] {% endif %}{{ w.objective or w.title }} (started {{ w.created }}{% if w.from_list is defined and w.from_list %}; made from {{ w.from_list }}{% endif %})
{% if w.get("shown_under") %}  where it stands is shown under [{{ w.shown_under }}]
{% else %}{% with p = w.progress, pad = "  " %}{% include 'shared/work/work_progress.j2' %}{% endwith %}{% endif -%}
{% else -%}
(none)
{% endfor %}
## Work that ended in the last 18 hours (work that ended before today in one line each)
{% for w in s.work.ended -%}
{% if w.get("shown_under") %}- [{{ w.ref }}] {{ w.title }}: {{ w.status }}, last changed {{ w.updated }}; shown in full under [{{ w.shown_under }}]
{% elif w.get("before_today") %}- [{{ w.ref }}] {{ w.title }}: {{ w.status }} {{ w.updated_at | local_time }}{% if w.line %}; in a line (a summary): {{ w.line }}{% elif w.ended_because %}: {{ w.ended_because }}{% endif %}
{% else %}{% include 'shared/brain/past_work.j2' %}{% if w.from_list is defined and w.from_list %}- made from {{ w.from_list }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}{% else -%}
(none)
{% endfor %}
## Questions and notices waiting for the owner
{% for t in s.tickets -%}
- {{ t.title }}{% if t.message %}: {{ t.message }}{% endif %}
{% else -%}
(none)
{% endfor %}
{% with scheduled_reminder_history = s.reminders %}{% include 'shared/work/scheduled_reminders.j2' %}{% endwith %}

## Open concerns
{% for c in s.concerns -%}
{% if c.view is defined -%}
### {% if c.ref is defined %}[{{ c.ref }}] {% endif %}{{ c.title }} (record last changed {{ c.changed_at | local_time }})
{% with concerns = [c.view], brief_work = true %}{% include 'shared/work/concern_view.j2' %}{% endwith %}
On the brain's list for this concern:
{% for e in c.entries -%}
- {% if e.ref is defined %}[{{ e.ref }}] {% endif %}{{ e.what }}{% if e.assistant_part and e.assistant_part != e.what %} (the assistant: {{ e.assistant_part }}){% endif %}{% if e.when_local %}, {{ e.when_local }}{% endif %}; {{ e.status }}, decided {{ e.updated_at | local_time }}
{% if e.work is defined and e.work %}{% with w = e.work, pad = "  " %}{% include 'shared/brain/entry_work.j2' %}{% endwith %}{% endif -%}
{% else -%}
(nothing)
{% endfor %}
{%- for e in c.cancelled %}{% if loop.first %}Cancelled earlier (decisions already made):
{% endif %}- {{ e.what }}: cancelled {{ e.updated_at | local_time }}: {{ e.why }}
{% endfor -%}
{% if c.plan %}Its planner's proposal, written {{ c.plan.written_at | local_time }}: {{ c.plan.decision | replace("_", " ") }}{% if c.plan.hold_until %} until {{ c.plan.hold_until }}{% endif %}. Why: {{ c.plan.why }}
{% for x in c.plan.proposals -%}
- {% if x.action == "new" %}add: {{ x.what }} (the assistant: {{ x.assistant_part }}), {{ x.when }}{% elif x.action == "modify" %}change {% if x.ref %}[{{ x.ref }}]{% else %}an entry no longer open{% endif %} to: {{ x.what }} (the assistant: {{ x.assistant_part }}), {{ x.when }}{% else %}cancel {% if x.ref %}[{{ x.ref }}]{% else %}an entry no longer open{% endif %}{% endif %}. Why: {{ x.why }}
{% endfor -%}
{% else %}(its planner has not proposed anything yet)
{% endif %}
{% else -%}
- {% if c.ref is defined %}[{{ c.ref }}] {% endif %}{{ c.title }}{% if c.severity %} (severity: {{ c.severity }}){% endif %}; record last changed {{ c.changed_at | local_time }}
{% endif -%}
{% else -%}
(none)
{% endfor %}
